  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1541c877f0b23a24f898d51c4437f5ff, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CommentScript
  m_Comments: '

    This object just stores the backend data for the game to use. It will be made invisible on start.


    Visual tiles will be shown on another tilemap.


    An example where this is used is placing preview; this object doesn''t update until the tile is actually placed. Only the visible  tilemap updates.


    Z layer 0 is collision

    Z layer 1 is objects

'
